=== main.frg
#include <stdio>

task t() {
    try {
        wait(1);
    } catch (Error e) {
        wait(1);
    }
}

int main(){
    try {
        print(1);
    } catch (string e) {
        print(e);
    }
    throw 5;
    return 0;
}
=== error
wait() can't be used inside a catch { }
catch takes an Error, like: catch (Error e)
throw takes text (the error message), but this is an int
